    "body": "Surogate Rune 26B-A4B completed all 132,422 frozen requests through surogate's decisions endpoint. The run scores **57.24 Decision Index**, **43.24 balanced skill** and **41.91 breadth skill**.\r\n\r\n132,421 rows returned `ok` and 1 returned `error`: an HLE request that the endpoint's template-boundary guard refused. It scores as wrong. No request was reported unsupported, nothing was truncated and no options were removed.\r\n\r\nThe results dataset is gated on HuggingFace under [https://huggingface.co/datasets/surogate/decision-index-results]( https://huggingface.co/datasets/surogate/decision-index-results) , the kit's scoring files, the runner's environment and status records for all 32 shards, and the harness (the engine adapter and the launcher). It is gated because it carries the suite's GPQA and HLE text. Access requests are approved manually, so please request access from the dataset page and we will approve it promptly.\r\n\r\nThe evaluation was run on: 8 x NVIDIA RTX 5090 at a 400 W power cap.",
